.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Internal working documents — not published with this repository.
# The engineering plan carries design rationale and commercial context; CLAUDE.md
# is local assistant configuration. Keep them out of a public repo, and remember
# git history is permanent: never commit either, not even once.
oncokernel-contracts-engineering-plan.md
CLAUDE.md
